The files in this directory are copied from MAME 0.289 (https://github.com/mamedev/mame). They are only
built into development tools (the Mega Drive's reference, megadrive/reference/: mdref), never into a game.
The 68000 and Z80 cores the reference runs are arcade-decomp's copies (konami/reference/mame/m68000/ and
system32/reference/mame/z80/, each with its own LICENSE); the YM2612 is ymfm's (arcade-decomp's
system32/reference/ymfm/, its own LICENSE).

- src/devices/video/ (video/): the Mega Drive's VDP, the 315-5313 (315_5313.cpp, 315_5313.h; copyright
  David Haywood), and the 315-5124 it is built on (315_5124.cpp, 315_5124.h; copyright Wilbert Pol, Enik
  Land).
- src/devices/sound/ (sound/): the SN76496 family, the Sega PSG among them (sn76496.cpp, sn76496.h;
  copyright Nicola Salmoria).
- src/mame/sega/ (sega/): the Mega Drive / Genesis driver (megadriv.cpp, megadriv.h; copyright David
  Haywood).

The console's runtime (megadrive/runtime/src/: its memory maps, its VDP) follows the behavior of these files
under the same terms.

